---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="A small publishing studio">
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Your own little corner of the internet.</p>
      <h1 id="hero-title">A small<br />publishing studio<br />for a <em>kinder internet.</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">For people who care about what they put into the world.</p>
      <p class="intro">Your ideas. Your own blog.<br />Write, design, and publish with ChatGPT.</p>
      <a class="button" href="/auth/login?return=%2Faccount%2F">Make it yours →</a>
      <p class="fine">$9.99 / month · Your domain. Your writing.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-note" aria-label="Dashless promise"><span>Good stories<br />live here.</span><strong>↗</strong></div>
  </section>
  <section class="steps" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="steps-title">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">Three simple steps.</p><h2 id="steps-title">Make a place<br />for your ideas.</h2></div>
    <ol>
      <li><b>01</b><div><h3>Pick your address.</h3><p>Bring your own domain, or use an included .dashless.blog address.</p></div></li>
      <li><b>02</b><div><h3>Make it yours.</h3><p>Shape your words, photos, and ideas with ChatGPT.</p></div></li>
      <li><b>03</b><div><h3>Preview. Approve. Publish.</h3><p>Take a look, make your final tweaks, and share your blog.</p></div></li>
    </ol>
  </section>
  <section class="offer" id="pricing" aria-labelledby="offer-title">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">Made for curious humans.</p><h2 id="offer-title">One blog.<br /><em>All yours.</em></h2><p>WordPress hosting, your own address, private previews, and writing you can take with you.</p></div>
    <div class="ticket"><strong>$9.99</strong><span>/ month</span><ul><li>WordPress hosting</li><li>Your own domain</li><li>Private previews</li><li>Your writing to keep</li></ul><a class="button" href="/auth/login?return=%2Faccount%2F">Start your account →</a></div>
  </section>
  <section class="questions" aria-labelledby="questions-title"><p class="eyebrow">A few good questions.</p><h2 id="questions-title">Straight answers for curious humans.</h2><details><summary>Do I need to learn WordPress?</summary><p>No. Write posts, shape your design, and preview changes through conversation. You approve what goes live.</p></details><details><summary>Do I own my writing?</summary><p>Yes. Your content lives in WordPress. You can export it and take it with you.</p></details><details><summary>Can I bring my own domain?</summary><p>Yes. Add a domain you own from your account and follow the short DNS checklist.</p></details></section>
</Layout>
<style>
  .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:40px;align-items:center;padding:clamp(58px,9vw,120px) 0 90px}.hero h1{font:900 clamp(52px,7vw,100px)/.92 Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.075em;margin:18px 0 26px}.hero h1 em,.offer h2 em{font-style:normal;background:linear-gradient(transparent 72%,#dfff00 72%)}.lede{font:clamp(21px,2.4vw,30px)/1.3 Georgia,serif;max-width:20ch;margin:0 0 20px}.intro{font:16px/1.5 Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 28px}.hero-note{min-height:440px;display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;padding:30px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#efd3c6,#d9e4a3 52%,#e9d897);border:6px solid #fbf6eb;box-shadow:6px 7px 0 #201f22;transform:rotate(2deg);font:29px/1.05 Georgia,serif}.hero-note strong{font:100px/1 Arial;align-self:start}.fine{margin:18px 0 0}.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.65fr 1.35fr;gap:40px;padding:34px 0;border-block:1px solid #aaa399}.steps h2,.offer h2{font:400 clamp(36px,4.8vw,62px)/1 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:14px 0}.steps ol{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}.steps li{display:flex;gap:22px;padding:18px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa399}.steps li:last-child{border:0}.steps b{font:italic 30px/1 Georgia,serif;box-shadow:inset 0 -10px #dfff00}.steps h3{font:700 20px/1.2 Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 7px}.steps p{font:15px/1.5 Georgia,serif;margin:0;max-width:45ch}.offer{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .75fr;gap:40px;padding:90px 0}.offer>div:first-child p:not(.eyebrow){font:20px/1.5 Georgia,serif;max-width:36ch}.ticket{align-self:start;background:#edd897;padding:30px;box-shadow:4px 5px 0 #201f2230;transform:rotate(-1deg)}.ticket strong{font:58px/1 Georgia,serif}.ticket>span{font:18px Georgia,serif}.ticket ul{padding:0;list-style:none;font:17px/1.5 Georgia,serif}.ticket li:before{content:'✓';margin-right:10px}.questions{padding:0 0 84px;max-width:760px}.questions h2{font:400 36px/1.05 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:12px 0 28px}.questions details{border-top:1px solid #aaa399;padding:16px 0}.questions details:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid #aaa399}.questions summary{cursor:pointer;font:18px Georgia,serif}.questions details p{font:15px/1.6 Arial,sans-serif;max-width:60ch}.questions summary::marker{color:#ad5237}@media(max-width:760px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:48px 0 58px}.hero-note{min-height:280px}.steps,.offer{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px}.offer{padding:58px 0}.ticket{max-width:420px}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(52px,14vw,82px)}}
</style>
